msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/general.js:222
msgid ""
"Addresses that are allocated to the peers from this pool, one address per "
"connected peer."
msgstr "从该地址池中分配给各对等方的地址，每个已连接的对等方分配一个地址。"

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/general.js:219
