msgstr "高级"

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1348
msgid "Aggressive Mode"
msgstr "激进模式"

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1354
msgid ""
"Aggressive Mode with PSK authentication is rejected as responder unless it "
"is allowed in the service configuration (General Settings)."
msgstr ""
"若服务配置（“常规设置”）中未明确允许，则作为响应方时，将拒绝采用 PSK 身份验证"
"的“激进模式”。"

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1446
#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:1456
